{"0":"{\n  \"workspaceDir\": \"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\n  \"managedSkillsDir\": \"/root/.openclaw/skills\",\n  \"skills\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"feishu-bitable\",\n      \"description\": \"飞书多维表格（Bitable）的创建、查询、编辑和管理工具。包含 27 种字段类型支持、高级筛选、批量操作和视图管理。**当以下情况时使用此 Skill**：(1) 需要创建或管理飞书多维表格 App(2) 需要在多维表格中新增、查询、修改、删除记录（行数据）(3) 需要管理字段（列）、视图、数据表(4) 用户提到\\\"多维表格\\\"、\\\"bitable\\\"、\\\"数据表\\\"、\\\"记录\\\"、\\\"字段\\\"(5) 需要批量导入数据或批量更新多维表格\",\n      \"eligible\": true,\n      \"disabled\": false,\n      \"blockedByAllowlist\": false,\n      \"source\": \"openclaw-extra\",\n      \"bundled\": false,\n      \"missing\": {\n        \"bins\": [],\n        \"anyBins\": [],\n        \"env\": [],\n        \"config\": [],\n        \"os\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"feishu-calendar\",\n      \"description\": \"飞书日历与日程管理工具集。包含日历管理、日程管理、参会人管理、忙闲查询。\",\n      \"eligible\": true,\n      \"disabled\": false,\n      \"blockedByAllowlist\": false,\n      \"source\": \"openclaw-extra\",\n      \"bundled\": false,\n      \"missing\": {\n        \"bins\": [],\n        \"anyBins\": [],\n        \"env\": [],\n        \"config\": [],\n        \"os\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"feishu-channel-rules\",\n      \"description\": \"Lark/Feishu channel output rules. Always active in Lark conversations.\",\n      \"eligible\": true,\n      \"disabled\": false,\n      \"blockedByAllowlist\": false,\n      \"source\": \"openclaw-extra\",\n      \"bundled\": false,\n      \"missing\": {\n        \"bins\": [],\n        \"anyBins\": [],\n        \"env\": [],\n        \"config\": [],\n        \"os\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"feishu-create-doc\",\n      \"description\": \"创建飞书云文档。从 Lark-flavored Markdown 内容创建新的飞书云文档，支持指定创建位置（文件夹/知识库/知识空间）。\",\n      \"eligible\": true,\n      \"disabled\": false,\n      \"blockedByAllowlist\": false,\n      \"source\": \"openclaw-extra\",\n      \"bundled\": false,\n      \"missing\": {\n        \"bins\": [],\n  